*> Acceptance test (lane p49x; docs/protocol/20 section 11, 13.3.1, 15.3): the witch takes 15 percent of magic, indirect magic and sonic boom damage (tag witch_resistant_to) and full damage from
*> every other source; the evoker fang's bite on a witch is cut the same way. The loss is read in thousandths from the health and the fractional loss (EN-HEALTH, EN-HEALTH-MILLI).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-MOB-20-11-RESIST.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY RULES.
 COPY EVKSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-LABEL               PIC X(240).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WITCH-TYPE          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ZOMBIE-TYPE         BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-WITCH               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ZOMBIE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AMOUNT              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAUSE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-WARM                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-BEFORE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LOSS                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FX0                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FZ0                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FYI                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FSIZE               BINARY-LONG VALUE 40.
 01 WS-FKIND               BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "minecraft:witch" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-WITCH-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "minecraft:zombie" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-ZOMBIE-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     COMPUTE WS-FX0 = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-X(WS-PLAYER)) - 20
     COMPUTE WS-FZ0 = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-Z(WS-PLAYER)) - 20
     COMPUTE WS-FYI = FUNCTION INTEGER(PL-Y(WS-PLAYER)) - 1
     CALL "MS-TEST-FLOOR" USING WS-DIM WS-FX0 WS-FZ0 WS-FSIZE WS-FYI WS-FKIND
     MOVE PL-X(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-X
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Y
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Z
     COMPUTE WS-X = WS-X + 6
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-WITCH-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-WITCH
     COMPUTE WS-X = WS-X + 3
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-ZOMBIE-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-ZOMBIE
     MOVE 6 TO WS-AMOUNT
     MOVE WS-WITCH TO WS-ROW
     MOVE CAUSE-MAGIC TO WS-CAUSE
     MOVE "a witch loses 0.9 of 6 magic damage" TO WS-LABEL
     MOVE 900 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM HURT-ROW
     MOVE CAUSE-INDIRECT-MAGIC TO WS-CAUSE
     MOVE "and 0.9 of 6 indirect magic damage" TO WS-LABEL
     PERFORM HURT-ROW
     MOVE CAUSE-SONIC-BOOM TO WS-CAUSE
     MOVE "and 0.9 of 6 sonic boom damage" TO WS-LABEL
     PERFORM HURT-ROW
     MOVE CAUSE-ARROW TO WS-CAUSE
     MOVE "but all 6 of an arrow" TO WS-LABEL
     MOVE 6000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM HURT-ROW
     MOVE WS-ZOMBIE TO WS-ROW
     MOVE CAUSE-MAGIC TO WS-CAUSE
     MOVE "a zombie loses all 6 of magic damage" TO WS-LABEL
     MOVE 6000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     PERFORM HURT-ROW
*>   The bite of an owner-less fang on a witch.
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-WITCH) TO WS-BEFORE
     COMPUTE WS-BEFORE = EN-HEALTH(WS-WITCH) * 1000 - EN-HEALTH-MILLI(WS-WITCH)
     MOVE 0 TO EN-HURT(WS-WITCH)
     MOVE EN-X(WS-WITCH) TO WS-X
     MOVE EN-Y(WS-WITCH) TO WS-Y
     MOVE EN-Z(WS-WITCH) TO WS-Z
     CALL "EVK-FANG-ADD" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-WARM WS-ZERO
     PERFORM 8 TIMES
         CALL "EVK-FANG-TICK"
     END-PERFORM
     COMPUTE WS-LOSS = WS-BEFORE - (EN-HEALTH(WS-WITCH) * 1000 - EN-HEALTH-MILLI(WS-WITCH))
     MOVE "an owner-less fang's bite takes 0.9 from a witch" TO WS-LABEL
     MOVE 900 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LOSS TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-LINE
     STOP RUN.

*> A hit of WS-AMOUNT points of WS-CAUSE on WS-ROW through HEALTH-MOB-DAMAGE; the loss in thousandths is the observed value.
 HURT-ROW.
     MOVE 0 TO EN-HURT(WS-ROW)
     COMPUTE WS-BEFORE = EN-HEALTH(WS-ROW) * 1000 - EN-HEALTH-MILLI(WS-ROW)
     CALL "HEALTH-MOB-DAMAGE" USING WS-ROW WS-AMOUNT WS-CAUSE WS-ZERO
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = WS-BEFORE - (EN-HEALTH(WS-ROW) * 1000 - EN-HEALTH-MILLI(WS-ROW))
     PERFORM ASSERT-LINE
     .

 ASSERT-LINE.
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "acceptance US15 20§11 Witch resistance: " DELIMITED BY SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-LABEL) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     .
 END PROGRAM TEST-MOB-20-11-RESIST.
 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
